You brought the Magic Censer. Thank you very much.

Salon did a great job. Now we just need to burn the Faugn Tentacles like incense.
The heat focused on a single point, strengthened by the Magic Censer, will make the sample try to regenerate and, at that moment, it will produce the substance holding the energy used to create the Faugn's protective membrane.

It will take me some time to light it and awaken that power.

Please, come back in a while.
